## `fundere`: los campos del embed se promueven. `e.position` se emite como
## `e.gameObj.position` en lectura, en `set` y dentro de `with:`. El campo
## propio gana si el host declara el mismo nombre (shadowing).
import std.spark

rune GameObj:
    position as int
    speed as int

rune Enemy fundere GameObj:
    health as int
    speed as int

weave main into int:
    var e as Enemy is with gameObj is (with position is 1, speed is 2), health is 3, speed is 9
    set e.position is e.position + 10
    with e:
        set .position is .position + 1
    calling spark.println with "{e.position},{e.speed},{e.health},{e.gameObj.speed}"
    return 0
